---
/**
 * Single source of truth for UI icons (Lucide-style, 24px grid, 2px stroke).
 * Inline SVG inherits `currentColor`, so icons follow theme, hover and focus
 * states automatically and add no network requests.
 *
 * Semantics: icons are decorative (aria-hidden). Meaning that matters to
 * assistive tech (e.g. "opens in new tab") is conveyed as visually-hidden text
 * next to the icon, never by the icon alone.
 */
